Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald had been diagnosed with prostate cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德被诊断出患有前列腺癌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Something that Kaleb and I discussed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在卡莱布和我努力完成 我们缺席的朋友常做的工作时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}while trying to do what our absent friend normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们讨论了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}废话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's bloody complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 这好复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've been phoning round doctors and things I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基于医生的描述和我的了解...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And his odds are really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他康复的几率很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But it's scaring him to death. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但诊断结果让他吓得要命 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他不明白 你知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I know he doesn't understand. And he's bewildered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 我知道他不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because, for obvious reasons, somebody said : "Sorry, it's cancer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他昏了头...显然是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's all he heard. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人说:“对不起 你得了癌症” 他就只听见了这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's desperately upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他极其沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Terrified, poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吓坏了 可怜人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a strong man. He's worked the land all of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是一个坚强的小伙子 一辈子都在这片土地上劳作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's not unfit, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 我是说... - 他还没病到不能工作 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He can do a day's work at...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他可以工作一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What age is he? - 74.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他多大了?70 岁? - 74 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第十八集 配种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We were now heading into late autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在逐步迈入深秋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And on Kaleb's side of the farm, in one of the arable fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布负责管理的这部分耕地农场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}things were not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进展并不顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, Jeremy and Charlie said it was too late to plant oilseed rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 杰里米和查理说 现在来不及种油菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I took the decision, as farm manager now, to plant it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}作为现任农场经理 我决定自己亲自种植油菜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And unfortunately, it's failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不幸的是 计划失败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真他妈烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when Kaleb came over to see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当卡莱布过来见我时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he became even more annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他更生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那他妈是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's interesting you should ask that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这么问很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it's actually half of Groove Armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那是古菲阿曼达二人组的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谁? - 古菲...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Half of... He was in Groove Armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是古菲阿曼达的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what that is. Why is he drilling my field?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道那是谁 他为什么在我的地里播种?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The thing is that fellow Doncaster-boy Andy Cato
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事情是这样的 唐卡斯特男孩安迪卡托
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}no longer does this for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不再靠接下来这事为生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like me, he's now moved into farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他和我一样 现在也从事农业工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a couple of weeks earlier, he and his business partner, George Lamb,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几周前 他和他的商业伙伴乔治兰姆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had dropped round to talk about their big idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来找我讨论他们的伟大计划
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I know it's called regenerative farming. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你们想打造的 是叫再生农场 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'd really like to understand what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我很想知道它具体是指什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our current farming system declares war on natural systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总的来说 我们目前的农业系统 与自然系统处于敌对关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And tt's got us in a bit of a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这让我们陷入了困境
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our soils have been pounded and poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的土壤已经受到严重破坏和污染 以至于它们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to a point where they're within a few decades of giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能在几十年后就会崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've lost 80% of our insects, so we can't keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经失去了80%的昆虫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们不能沿用此系统
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Regenerative farming is a way of farming which tries to copy natural systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再生农业是一种模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自然系统的农业方式
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But it's not organic? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但那不是有机农业 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In organic, the main thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有机农业的关键 在于不使用任何化学品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is about not using any chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where we're different is we're about assessing each bit of farmland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们的不同之处在于 我们致力于评估每一块农田
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and trying to figure out what it needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并试图弄清楚它需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if we took the plant and we took a reading from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们会走进地里 采集植物 从中获取所需数据
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it told us that you were missing boron,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果数据表明你的农田
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or magnesium or something specific,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}缺少硼或镁 或者其他特定元素
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we can feed according to need,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以按需补充
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rather than going and just dumping thousands of kilos onto the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而不是把数千公斤的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}倒在地里 这就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那正是我们所做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We filled a sprayer up with gallons and gallons of chemicals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只是简单地把喷雾器 灌满一加仑又一加仑的化学品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and just go out and do every field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后撒到每块地里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Andy then explained that the goal with regenerative farming
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随后 安迪解释说 再生农业的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was to copy the way nature likes to mix things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是复制大自然的生长方式
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One thing you'll never find in the woods or along a hedgerow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一种情况你永远不会在 任何树林 甚至是树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or any natural system,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}亦或自然系统中看到 那就是只有一种植物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is one type of plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nature never allows one type of plant to grow in a big area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大自然从不允许 同一种植物大面积生长在一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you look in a drought year like this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想想干旱的年份 比如今年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all the bits that stood up to it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有经受住干旱考验的地方 都是树篱和林地等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}are the hedgerows, the woodlands and the bits that we haven't touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们没有干预的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bits that have stayed green?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你是说仍然郁郁葱葱的地方? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 正如树篱 林地或草地证明的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as the hedgerow or the woodland or the meadowland prove,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when that's working,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在生态自然体系中 你无需人为加入任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you don't need to put anything on it. Nature's got it sorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为大自然会自行解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we've got to get away from is monocultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们需要摆脱单一栽培体系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}注意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're suggesting planting wheat and something else
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是在建议在同一块田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- in the same field at the same time? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}同时种植小麦和其他作物?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the idea of wheat and beans is a good starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以同时种小麦和豆子的想法 是一个很好的开端...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- In the same field? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在同一块地里? - 在同一块地里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two things are happening there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这块田地里会发生两件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One is that the nitrogen from the atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一是大气中的氮素 它占大气的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of which there's an infinite abundance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}80% of it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 80% 对吧? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The beans are taking that down and putting it in the soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有豆子会吸收大气中的氮素 并将其释放到土壤中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to replace fertiliser inputs. - The beans are?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}取代我们需要投入的化肥 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The beans are. - They're great nitrogen fixers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说豆子?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 因为它们是很好的固氮植物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And so, by putting two plant families in the same field,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样一来 通过将两种植物 种在同一块地里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we're starting that process of feeding the soil microbes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们开始了喂养土壤微生物的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we need to help recover with a diversity of plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有助于 通过植物的多样性来恢复土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your yields are going to be way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但显然 你的产量会大幅降低
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're not going to grow as many beans as if you just had a bean field
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的豆子的产量不如单种豆子那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or as much wheat, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毫无疑问 你的小麦收成 也肯定不及单一的麦田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The overall output will be higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那块地的总产值会增加
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的吗? - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我明白你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Net-margin-wise, at the bottom line. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你是说净利润 最终赢利 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Overall you might do less yield in actual weight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 总的来说 用我们的方案 你的实际产量可能会减少
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you take all those input costs out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果你把所有投入的成本都去掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for example, the chemical prices are going up and up and up -
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如不断增长的化学品价格
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our margin is higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的利润会更高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Plus, you're also building health into your soil
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}此外 你还会让土壤更加健康
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so you can farm indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着你可以一直用其耕种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you carry on using the same extractive system based on chemicals,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你继续使用相同的耗竭性体系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the likelihood is in a couple of generations' time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它完全依赖化学品 很可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在几代人的时间内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you won't be able to produce food on your farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的农场就再也无法产粮了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if we started to think not in terms of yield,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果我们不再看重产量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like the weight we get out of a field, but in how much money...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不再死盯着一块地里 能收获的作物的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而开始考虑多少钱...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We only ever talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为之前只讨论每英亩产多少吨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We got so many tonnes per acre."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we start to talk about how many pounds per acre...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们开始讨论每英亩 能赚多少英镑、先令和便士...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I like the sound of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - 我喜欢这个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, because you're not having to give Mr CF Industries
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 因为你不必
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£1,000 for your fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给化肥公司十万英镑购买化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then came the really enticing bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来是真正诱人的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Andy and George would guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安迪和乔治保证
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to buy any crops we grew using their method
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会溢价购买我们用他们的方式 种植出来的任何作物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for a premium price.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 当然了 - 你们买吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We buy it off you at a premium. - That's even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会溢价购买
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 那就更好了 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You buy for more than I would get from an ordinary grain merchant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们会以比普通粮商能给出的 更高的价格购买 还是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 毫无疑问 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who do you sell it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你们卖给谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're at about 250 regular customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}截止今日 我们有大约250名常客
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that spreads from small artisan bakeries
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}包括从小规模手工面包店
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to Marks & Spencers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到玛莎百货
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Marks & Spencers? - Marks & Spencers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 玛莎百货? - 玛莎百货...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Marks & Spencers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玛莎百货 所以 你们卖给 我们的面粉可以进入玛莎百货
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So your flour that you sell us can be going into M&S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie and I were sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理和我被说服了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'd handed over one of the fields to Andy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我把其中一块地交给了安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To see if his new soil-friendly system would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看他的新土壤友好系统是否可行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, I just had to hope that Kaleb wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我只希望卡莱布不会介意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's pissing me off seeing him in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看见他在地里让我非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't know what he's drilling yet, wheat and beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不知道他在种什么 他在种小麦和豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I see a bean bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我看见了一袋豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, he's got wheat and beans in his hopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 他的料斗里有小麦和豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's my field, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但那是我的地 在过去六年里 一直是我在那块地里播种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've drilled this field for the last 6 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You won't have to this year because he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么 今年你就不用播种了 因为他在种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's putting it in with a disc drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他在用圆盘播种机播种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's not gonna work. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这也行不通 - 为什么不行?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look out there. What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看那里 你看到了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Mud. - No. The other thing with the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 除了泥土以外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Stones. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 石头 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how a disc drill works?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道圆盘播种机的工作原理吗? 为此 我们准备了齿式播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got a tine drill for that reason. It moves the stone out the way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会把挡路的石头移开 然后再播种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then plants the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 对吧?你直接使用圆盘播种机的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You put a disc drill through that, that'll go over the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会越过石头 把种子种在石头里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and plant the seed on top of the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Will it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's probably on Boy's Land. This is Man's Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他可能只种过软土 但这是“硬”土
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then put on my "Boutros Boutros" hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我戴上了外交官之帽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it was time for the two of them to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为现在该让他们俩见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Be nice. Don't be petulant like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}友善待人 别像个孩子一样任性
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Andy, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安迪 这是卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How you doing? - Kaleb, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗? - 卡莱布 安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He's thrilled. - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我很好 - 他很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He's thrilled. - Looking pretty thrilled, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很高兴见到你 - 他当然很兴奋 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Oh, here's somebody else. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看起来很兴奋 是啊 - 不 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯...又有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Been planting with a trowel? Scratching like a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 - 你一直用泥铲种植吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 像小鸡一样到处乱抓 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first thing he says is you're using
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他首先提到你在用圆盘播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a disc drill, which won't work in that field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那机器不适用于那块地 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? There's a lot of stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那块地有很多石头 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Do you think it'll work? I'm with you with the stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得那样能行?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就石头这事 我同意你的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This drill is set up to sow two things at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我之所以使用这种播种机 是因为它能同时播种两种作物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and put a bit of probiotic liquid down with the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并在播种的同时加入一些益生菌液
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we get through the stones, we can get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 如果我们能让种子穿过石头 就能完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the liquid for? Fertiliser?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那液体有什么用?充当肥料?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's like, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 因为我们正在努力...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna try and bring the soil back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会试着让这块地的土壤 重新焕发生机 并且...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and get all the things... - It is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“重新焕发生机” 本来就生机勃勃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I farm that bit there and you rip this bit up and put your...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是在告诉我 如果我在那块地种植 而你给它翻土 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whatever you're doing, in here, you'll get a better yield?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按你的想法随意种植 你的产量会比我高?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是的 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Would you make more money than I would?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你赚的钱会比我多?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, let's go back a step, because if...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们退后一步 因为如果...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're tall as the sun. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我像是在仰头跟太阳说话一样 - 啥意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If... - My neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果... - 我的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want me to come down the downslope?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我应该站在下坡的地方吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 如果可以的话 这就好多了 - 好了 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, better. - That's better!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you planting? Wheat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我看到你把两种...你是在种小麦?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And beans. - How do you harvest it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and not lose anything out the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么...那你怎么收割 而不漏掉任何东西呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You set it so you're not losing anything out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你设置好就不会漏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It'll go through a grain cleaner. - Which costs more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收获的作物会经过谷物清选机 我们会把庄稼分开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那也会花更多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't have to take care of that because part of the deal is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你们不必担心这件事 因为我们的协议还说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that we'll just take the wheat and beans together and we'll sort it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会买走我们一起种植的 小麦和豆子 我们会解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They do that. - Do we sell it to you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们负责 - 那我们要把产物卖给你?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 对 而且他们会溢价购买
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they pay a premium. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Next question, then. Was you in a band?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那下一个问题 你以前是乐队的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I was. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 以前是 - 看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}何以见得?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because you've left your tractor running at a pound a litre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你竟然没让拖拉机熄火 一升油要一英镑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was now late November.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是十一月末
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I had my head buried in my latest homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正埋头研究最新的“家庭作业”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yorkshire pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}约克夏猪 你在看谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because despite Charlie's protests, I'd bought some pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为尽管查理反对 我还是买了几头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and their arrival was only days away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 它们就会到达农场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Corrugated iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}波纹铁皮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我不得不在土豆田里 建三个大畜栏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to get three big pens built in the potato field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This would be a lot of work and I really needed some expert help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这工作量很大 我真的需要专家帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb is ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}First rule, you would have thought with farming, you go to work. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本以为干农活的第一个原则 就是你得去工作 没什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There is a really bad cold going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在感冒很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, but it's a cold! - It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 但感冒 不就是感冒嘛 - 很严重的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Foetuses. Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他就是个宝宝 小题大做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could you grab the telehandler? Since it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}既然这是紧急情况 你能开那个伸缩臂叉车吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:11:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:11:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这排场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the Diddly Squat Heavy Machinery Unit
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场 重型机械队开始行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}swinging into action here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼 好大的风
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! I've got my own sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不!我带着自己的“帆”呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what pigs I'm getting? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你听说我要养什么猪了吗? - 没
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're called Shandy and Blacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们叫牛津桑迪黑猪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ooh! - And they are from...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至于它们的产地 看见那边的森林了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- See the forest over there? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's where they're from. Forest of Wychwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们来自威奇伍德森林
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You are kidding? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你开玩笑的吧 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A few years ago... - Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几年前只剩一头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}man pig left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Boar? - Yeah. One left in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 公猪? - 对 全世界仅剩一头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way? - And it was rescued by a farm in Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的 迪恩的一个农场救下了它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're bringing it back. So I've decided to get Shandy and Blacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们把它带回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我决定养桑迪黑猪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It sounds like a sort of thing a northern woman would drink in a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这听起来像是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}北方女人周五晚上在酒吧里喝的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}83 m ? - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 83米? - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the other corner. - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那么 这里放另一根角柱 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, a farmer! At work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 一个农民 正在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Possibly with a light cold, mild flu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能患有轻度感冒 轻度流感 但还能继续工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but able to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having measured out the pens, our next job was to install the fences
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}测量完畜栏后 我们的下一个任务是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}using a post knocker I'd nicked from Kaleb's yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用从卡莱布院子里偷来的 立柱敲打机安装围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What we need to do is get that pin... In the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要做的是把这根销钉... - 在中间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Into there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...插到那里 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are we happy? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了吗? - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you imagine putting someone's head there? 'Oomph! Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能想象把人的脑袋放在那里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Gangs of London." - This would be a great one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 人肯定就没了 -《伦敦黑帮》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We should do "Gangs of Chipping Norton"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很适合《伦敦黑帮》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们应该拍《奇平诺顿黑帮》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put people's heads on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把人脑袋放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall I put these every 3 metres? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我应该每隔三米放一根立柱吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It really is raining now and officially night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在真的下雨了 而且正式入夜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've done the maths. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我已经计算过了... - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we're gonna have to put in 75 fence posts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们得放75根围栏立柱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before we start putting the actual fencing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后再放置真正的围栏 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're not quick, but it is our first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们动作好慢 但今天是第一天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep. - And we can be proud of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有道理 - 我们可以为自己而骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两天后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, we've gotta thread this through here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我们得把这个穿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh, that was juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, now, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I drive forwards, it's going to tension it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我往前开的时候 网会绷紧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不行 杰里米!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy? Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've pulled it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把柱子拉倒了
