Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我朝你喊 你却听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What have I pulled over? - You pulled the last post over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我把什么拉倒了? - 你把最后一根立柱拉倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eejit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking ripped the whole thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把整件事都搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're meant to be looking at me.
