Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We could have used the phone. - We can all blame each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你可以打电话告诉我的 - 我们可以互相指责
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不是的
