Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在试图确保围栏前面不会晃动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Blame each other"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}互相指责?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have to put the post-- How are we gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把角柱放在...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait. This is more of a problem. No, stop just for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们怎么...等等 这问题更严重了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别 别说话 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The corner post has to go there to be in line with that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}角柱必须放在这里 与那边对齐 还要与这边对齐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and in line with this. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we've loosened the ground up, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经松动了地面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We hav-- "We" have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们” 你可真会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, "we" have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When the fences were all up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}围栏全部安装好后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we quickly discovered we'd given ourselves a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们很快发现 我们又给自己制造了一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on. Let's think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 我们想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you open that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以打开那扇门吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. So we have to open this one first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以我们必须先打开这扇 我们得把这扇拆下来 对吧?
