Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, if we open this one first...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 如果我们先打开这扇...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, it's... - We fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不对 这... - 我们搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I know we did. It should've been... - So take that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 那个畜栏不应该...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以把它拆掉 - 对 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Despite the setbacks, though, we managed without Kaleb or Charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管跌跌撞撞 我们仍成功在卡莱布和查理不在时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to finish the pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}建好了畜栏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, we had to start work on the pig houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们不得不开始建猪舍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which came with my least favourite thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中有我最不喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an instruction manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}使用说明书
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From this to this in 30--? Fuck off! 30 minutes my arse. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从这样到这样要30...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 去你的 要30分钟 - 什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That goes on there like that, yeah? - Oh, yeah? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那要放在那里 就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对吧? - 对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's IKEA, but for pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像是宜家 不过是给猪的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that on the... where it's painted?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是在...被涂过颜色的地方吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Okay. - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh for fuck's sake! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真烦人 - 是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么? - 没有门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We were supposed to use that. Oh those go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们应该用那个 - 那些要安在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I picked up the nearest bit of wood. I didn't realise you needed a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我捡起最近的一块木头 却没发现你需要一扇门...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But pigs need doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但猪需要门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've gotta swivel it round, haven't we? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把它转过来 不是吗?没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've now been exactly half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们已经装了整整半个小时了 - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:16:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa? Arya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 艾莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! I'm going backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我弄反了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa! Arya! Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 艾莉亚 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa? Arya? Dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 艾莉亚 狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐 艾莉亚 坐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, look, well, it's firm-- ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 看 很坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's good. Let's get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 我们去装一块 下一块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't remember how many days it's taken us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不记得我们花了多少天 来建造这个猪猪迁徙中心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to build this pig migration centre,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but we have pretty much done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们已经基本完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完美
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am actually feeling really rather pleased with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我其实对此相当满意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If there's any pig farmers watching who wanna write in, do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果有养猪户在看 想写信给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mark your envelope: "Yeah, we were impressed as well."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}请确保在信封上标明 “是的 我们也印象深刻”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Diddly Squat Farm, Chipping Norton, Oxfordshire."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}地址是牛津郡奇平诺顿 迪丽斯库阿特农场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, despite our best efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但尽管我们尽了最大努力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the pig hotel wasn't quite finished
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当客人抵达时 猪猪旅馆还没有彻底完工
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the time our guests arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm Jeremy. Hello, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我是杰里米 你好啊 - 你好 杰里米 日安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you? This is Lisa. Wherever she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这位是丽莎 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, there. How are you? Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗?嗨 - 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nice to meet you too. Hi. I'm Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 幸会 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 我是彼得 - 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi. Josh. Nice to meet you. - Hello, Josh. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 乔什 幸会 - 嗨 乔什 你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What have you got here? Proper pig boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们拿的是什么? - 正规的猪板
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是用来做什么的? - 用来把猪赶进围场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To steer the pigs in the paddocks, so they don't run that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样它们就不会乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, you use the board. I see. Oh, right. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们用板子 我懂了 - 太棒了 好的 简单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't put them on a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不能拴着它们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've seen Babe! I know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我看过《小猪崽宝贝》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道流程
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小猪崽猪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How old are these ones? About a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这些猪多大? - 一岁左右
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are they what you call weaners? Or are they gilts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是所谓的断奶小猪崽? 还是小母猪?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moving on from weaners to gilts, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}处于断奶小猪崽到小母猪的过渡期
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't wait to get them. Can we get them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我等不及让它们回家了 能把它们弄出来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, they are fantastic! Look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 走 - 它们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You rare breed, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它们 你们可是稀有品种
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So those are how old? They're coming up to a year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么 那些多大?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们快满一岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love their socks they've got on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢它们的“小袜子”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there's one... Oh, bigger pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但有一头猪 体型大点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Much bigger pig coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更大的猪来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why is this one so much bigger? She's much older.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么这头大这么多?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她年龄大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How old is she? - This is a breeding sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为... - 她多大?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}About two. So she has had baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这是一头种母猪 大约两岁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They haven't met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以她产过崽 它们之前没见过面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, haven't they? No. So there might be a little
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗? - 没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of working who's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 可能需要花点功夫弄清谁是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll keep these back, shall I? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会把它们赶到后面去 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And they're all lady pigs? All lady pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们都是母猪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 都是母猪 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've got their hackles up on the back of their neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看到它们脖子后面竖起的毛了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像狗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's how you know they're getting a bit grouchy with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以通过那撮毛 知道它们开始对彼此不满
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they just don't like each other because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们不喜欢彼此 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've not met before. They'll make friends soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们以前没见过面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很快就会成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fight! Fight! Fight! Girls, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 打起来 - 姑娘们 乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a proper...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这不合适 - 她比它们大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's much bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but they've got each other, so they'll stand their ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它们会支持彼此 因此它们会坚守阵地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall we get the electric gates on? There you go. You're on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要打开电动门吗?好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 现在打开了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're on. So if they touch it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们打开了 所以 如果它们碰到围栏...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 - 有用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The electric fence is on. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}电围栏当然已经打开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was then time to put the young piglets in their compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 是时候把小猪崽 赶进它们的围场了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ten in here for you. I'm looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给你打开闸门
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很期待 这会很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, piggies. Welcome to Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 小猪崽们 欢迎来到迪丽斯库阿特农场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're gorgeous. Aren't they fantastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们很美 不 别动 - 它们很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, they're glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggly Squat. That's what the herd's called.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪丽斯库阿特 这群就叫这名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is a superb breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:49.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这名字很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When the sun shines on them, they look metallic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当阳光照到它们身上时 它们会闪烁着金属的光泽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Chestnut. They're like conkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 板栗 它们像七叶树果实
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody here will remember the NSU Ro 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里没人会记得 NSU Ro 80
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was a car called the NSU Ro 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}曾经有一款车叫 NSU Ro 80
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You used to be able to get that in exactly the same colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那车以前有一模一样的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? - A sort of metallic bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的 没错 - 一种金属青铜色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's found the potatoes, look. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它已经找到土豆了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're gorgeous. Look at them running around. They like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看它们跑来跑去的 它们喜欢这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa's beside herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎兴奋极了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aren't they just the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们难道不是最棒的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"It's potatoes! Potatoes!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土豆 土豆呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at them! They've gone mental!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看它们多疯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, this is lunch! It's literally lunch everywhere you look!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放眼望去 遍地都是午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They all follow each other. Oh my God, they're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们全跟着彼此 太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one thinks it's a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那头以为自己是一只狗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在这里做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So how long are they here for? A couple of months?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们要在这里待多久? 待几个月 然后去树林?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. They winter up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它们在这里过冬...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, girlies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嘿 姑娘们 - ...所以它们吃完所有土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Till they've eaten all the potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:21:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then they're off. Oh! The Piggly Squats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:21:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后就出发 - 猪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Finally, we had to release the last group of pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后 我们不得不把最后一批猪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into the pen where... sex would take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放进交配用的围栏里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this for the middle field is a sow, a gilt and a boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中间那块地 会放一头母猪 一头小母猪和一头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So sows had babies before? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这头母猪以前生过崽 对吧? - 对 小母猪...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A gilt-- A gilt hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小母猪还没
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is Mabel. She can be a bit cheeky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是梅布尔 她脸皮可能有点厚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Mabel is a sow? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 梅布尔是成熟的母猪? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来吧 莎拉 - 过来 莎拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, darling. Come, pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下去吧 走 猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do know the boar is called Ajax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道公猪叫...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ajax? - Ajax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 阿贾克斯 - 阿贾克斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}阿贾克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a young boar. Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他是一头小公猪 - 对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's nowhere near as stocky as I thought he'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他不像我想象中那么粗壮 - 他还小呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's young, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here he goes. Look. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他出发了 看啊 - 好戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello. Look at this. This is the meeting of...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 看看这画面 这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Hello, sailor." Sarah and Ajax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“你好 水手” - ...莎拉和阿贾克斯的见面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一见钟情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, they're kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was, however, no time to enjoy this Mills & Boon moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 没时间享受 米尔斯和布恩的浪漫时刻...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we had to get the throuple's pig house built
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们必须在夜幕降临前 给“三猪关系”建好猪舍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here comes your house
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}阿贾克斯、莎拉还有梅布尔 你们的家来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.56,0:23:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ajax and Sarah and Mabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if there's a big "clonk", I could squidge a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果发出一声巨响 那可能是压到猪了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在天黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sow is now going to join Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}母猪现在来到了丽莎的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她在那儿吃什么?看见了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, no! More worryingly, here comes the boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好了 更令人担忧的是 公猪来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That is... Oh, no, no, no. Not all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是... - 不 别一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.16,0:24:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I'm sorry for the things that I told you ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But words only go so far ♪
