Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bacteria in your soil are making nitrogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这里的细菌在制造氮素
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A man from Groove Armada is making nitrogen in my soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}古菲阿曼达二人组中的一人 在我的土壤里制造氮素
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody's ever said that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以前从没人这么说过 之前没人说这话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.64,0:37:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's never been used as a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.96,0:37:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie and I then headed to the office
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.96,0:37:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接着 查理和我去了办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.12,0:37:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to discuss the council's enforcement notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.12,0:37:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论议会的强制执行通知
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关门通知
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.52,0:37:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which didn't just shut down the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.52,0:37:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不仅让我们关闭了餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It made running the farm shop nigh on impossible as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且几乎使农场商店无法经营
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They wanted us to close the small bar
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们还希望我们关闭小酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where customers could buy my Hawkstone beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}本来顾客可以在那儿 购买我的豪客斯通啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They didn't want us parking cars in the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们不希望我们把车停在田野里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And said the loos had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说厕所必须拆除
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.68,0:37:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And worst of all, they were insisting we shut the burger van.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.68,0:37:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 - 最糟糕的是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们坚持让我们关闭汉堡车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Check on one burger, two truffle, one chilli.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}核对一下 一份汉堡 两份松露 一份辣椒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对的 - 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which was now the only realistic way of selling our meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这是目前唯一现实的 销售我们的肉的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.64,0:38:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The restaurant, I could never see that coming back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.64,0:38:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}餐厅 我觉得它永远都回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.96,0:38:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but we had to do something to protect our shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.96,0:38:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们得采取行动 保护我们的商店
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Farm shop. - Farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 农场商店 - 农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We've got some choices to make. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要做出一些选择
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.64,0:38:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If they make that enforcement notice stick,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果他们坚持执行通知内容 禁止停车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"no car parking",
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they'll ban parking on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会禁止在路上停车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we won't be able to sell anything other than an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就只能卖苹果 别的都不能卖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I was thinking, why don't we try and move the farm shop
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我在想 不如我们把农场商店搬到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.12,0:38:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.12,0:38:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那在查德灵顿议会管辖范围外
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.08,0:38:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's out of Chadlington's parish council area.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And more importantly, this bit
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更重要的是 这个区域不属于自然风景区域
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.36,0:38:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}isn't in the Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.32,0:38:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. - So what if we put it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.32,0:38:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.28,0:38:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们把店开在那里呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.80,0:38:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We just close it down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.80,0:38:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不然我们就把这里的店关了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.76,0:38:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Massive losses with all of the work we've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.76,0:38:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}承受巨额损失 让我们所做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.00,0:38:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, getting power there, getting the loos installed,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.00,0:38:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那里安装的电力 设置的厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}concrete floor, everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}铺设的道路和一切都白费
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- building the shop itself. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还包括建造商店本身 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.52,0:38:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So why don't we go to the council and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.52,0:38:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们为何不前往议会说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:39:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"How would you feel if we moved the shop into the top end of the farm?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:39:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“如果我们把商店开到农场的顶端 你们感觉如何?”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I get the theory, I get the logic, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我懂你这套理论 也知道你的逻辑 但...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.04,0:39:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew there'd be a "but".
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.04,0:39:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就知道你要说“但是”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no guarantee that they will grant permission here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:09.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们无法保证在这里开店能获得许可
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we should do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们应该做的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.36,0:39:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Personally, I feel... - You think fight it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我个人觉得... - 你觉得 与之抗争?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think "fight" is necessarily the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得“抗争”这个词不太正确
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.28,0:39:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the emotive word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.28,0:39:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一个情绪化的词汇 但我认为我们应该
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But actually what I think we should do is put our views across
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以理性、逻辑且客观的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.16,0:39:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in a sensible, logical, objective way,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.16,0:39:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 表达我们的观点... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- which has not been... - Fight the fuckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后 跟那群混蛋抗争 - 这一步尚未完成
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.56,0:39:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which has not been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.76,0:39:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hammer them into the ground like tent pegs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.76,0:39:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把他们打得落花流水
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.08,0:39:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think some of their points probably we do need
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.08,0:39:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为反驳 他们的某些观点可能比其他的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.76,0:39:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to be more forceful than others. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.76,0:39:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 需要更多努力 - 并非全是坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.80,0:39:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And such as, you know... - Lavatories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.80,0:39:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 比如...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.32,0:39:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.16,0:39:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.16,0:39:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我们不... - 他们说我们不能留着厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They say we can't have a lavatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么 当你的店里有女店员 而你不被允许去...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.04,0:39:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So when you're a shopgirl there and you're not allowed to go to the...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.60,0:39:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There won't be a lavatory. - Or a shop-boy. You could be either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.60,0:39:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不会有厕所 - 或是男店员 两者都行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's more difficult. A boy can go behind a bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更难了 男店员可以去灌木丛解决 但女店员不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you need to go to the loo
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果你在工作 你需要上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.88,0:39:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you have to get in a car, close the shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.88,0:39:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那你上车去解决 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:39:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}come all the way down, back up. So there is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:39:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 关闭商店 对 - 关闭商店 一路走到车那边去解决
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.16,0:39:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后再回来 这就有问题了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, I think what we should do...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我觉得我们应该...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To not move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不搬
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不搬 跟律师谈谈 - 不跟他们抗争 但...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.64,0:40:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Speak to a barrister. - Not fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.64,0:40:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we put in a robust,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.64,0:40:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...然后我们给出有力而客观的回应
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.20,0:40:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- objective response. - Robust.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.20,0:40:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有力?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.96,0:40:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.96,0:40:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.28,0:40:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I've been watching Yellowstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.28,0:40:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在看《黄石》
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When somebody displeases them, they murder them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当有人惹恼他们时 他们会杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.40,0:40:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}take them across the state line and throw them into a ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.40,0:40:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}将他们带到州界 然后扔进峡谷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've been looking at that scene a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经看过那一幕很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.88,0:40:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie retreated to his own office
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.88,0:40:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理回到自己的办公室 开始处理上诉的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.40,0:40:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to start work on the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.84,0:40:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And while he did that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.84,0:40:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 丽莎和我 回到了那个泥泞的养猪业务
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.20,0:40:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and I went back to the muddy business of pig farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.68,0:40:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're stuck as I don't know what now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.68,0:40:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在寸步难行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're stuck in the mud. - Yeah, this ain't going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你陷入泥潭了 - 是啊 车开不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.36,0:41:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're coming out to see the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.36,0:41:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们出来看节目了 - 它们出来嘲笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.92,0:41:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, they're coming out to laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.28,0:41:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.28,0:41:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊 它们全都...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.12,0:41:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at them! They're hilarious! Their little ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.12,0:41:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看!你看它们 好搞笑 你看它们的小耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.00,0:41:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Look at our ears! Our ears!" - They're gonna line up and laugh at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.00,0:41:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们全都竖着耳朵! - 它们会排队嘲笑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.64,0:41:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're growing so fast. - They really are, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.64,0:41:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们长得真快 对吧? - 真的很快
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.88,0:41:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. I think we're gonna have to accept this is going to stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.88,0:41:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我觉得我们必须接受 车会留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until either we get some frost or...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}直到要么遇到霜冻天气
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, if I get the tractor, we can pull it out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要么 算了 我去开拖拉机 我们可以用它把车拖回去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.36,0:41:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As I returned with the Lambo, Lisa and I got a bit of a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.36,0:41:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我回去开拖拉机返回时 丽莎和我看到了一个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey. Oh, hey, K! How were the hols?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 卡莱布!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.36,0:41:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Judith! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.36,0:41:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}假期过得怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.28,0:41:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 朱迪斯 你回来了! - 假期棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.68,0:41:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Judith? Judith Chalmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.68,0:41:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}朱迪斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 朱迪斯查莫斯 - 那是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Holiday person. Doesn't matter. - I've been on holiday once.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 假期达人 不重要 - 我就只休了一次假
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.16,0:41:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.16,0:41:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还不错吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.64,0:41:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.64,0:41:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah! Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Last time I see this field, it was a lovely potato field.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我上次看这块地的时候 它还是块可爱的土豆田
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.32,0:42:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, but now look at it. It's a massive pig enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.32,0:42:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但看看它现在的样子 这是一个大规模养猪场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, it's brilliant, innit? - Firstly... Firstly hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这地棒极了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.40,0:42:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 听我说完
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who the fuck done the fencing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谁他妈安装的围栏? - 我们安装的!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.64,0:42:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们是指谁? - 丽莎和我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and me. In a rainstorm, at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在暴雨中建的 还是晚上 我们安装好了整个围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.68,0:42:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got the whole fencing done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it! - What's the matter with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看看这个 - 它有什么问题?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.76,0:42:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, firstly, you haven't even got all the posts the same height.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.76,0:42:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 你没把所有立柱打到同一高度
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.84,0:42:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that doesn't matter, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.84,0:42:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不重要 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It does!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很重要!而且那边有路 你看 再说一遍 我不能...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.60,0:42:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's the road! Look! Again, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.76,0:42:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't be picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.76,0:42:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不要挑刺
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.04,0:42:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's wrong with the road? - Everyone's gonna see it. It looks shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.04,0:42:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 路有什么问题? - 每个人都会看到它 太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.44,0:42:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I see- - Look! Look down that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.44,0:42:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 看... - 你看!看下面那条线
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.32,0:42:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you use a string line or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.32,0:42:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们用牵引线了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - Did you use a string line?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 你们用牵引线了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.16,0:42:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We didn't really have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.16,0:42:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们没时间弄牵引线
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.76,0:42:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We were really... We had to do it. It was a rush job.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.76,0:42:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们当时真的...做得很急
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.16,0:42:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, we've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.16,0:42:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我们做到了 安装好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.16,0:42:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not one has escaped. We put a sign on the road saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.16,0:42:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有猪逃跑 我们在路上放一个牌子 写上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.40,0:42:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Kaleb built these fences."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.40,0:42:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“卡莱布建的这些围栏”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.32,0:43:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's just all brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.32,0:43:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一切都很棒 - 它...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So... - The pigs look amazing, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.48,0:43:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以... - 其实猪看起来很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.28,0:43:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let me explain how it works, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.28,0:43:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我解释一下运作原理
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:05.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggy! - I've been reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 只是因为... - 小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.16,0:43:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We've got the weaners there. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.16,0:43:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在看一本书 我们把断奶小猪崽养在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.52,0:43:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got the boar and two sows in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.52,0:43:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 我们把公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we started there
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有两头成熟母猪养在这里 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.76,0:43:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then we put him in there with three sows.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.76,0:43:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这是开始 随后 我们把他和三头母猪关在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.68,0:43:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Three sows? Hang on. - So he's now done the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.68,0:43:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在他...等等
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.92,0:43:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 他现在跟母猪群一起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, there's been pig orgy going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老实说 猪猪海天盛筵正在上演
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You put the boar in here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你把公猪放在这里... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.92,0:43:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then in a week's space you put it in with the other lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.92,0:43:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...然后一周后 你把他跟其他母猪群关在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.40,0:43:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.40,0:43:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.16,0:43:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.16,0:43:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有什么问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you're joking? You're kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没 你在开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.88,0:43:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Please, tell me you're lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.88,0:43:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你一定是在撒谎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.96,0:43:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you counted their nipples?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.96,0:43:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有数过它们的乳头数吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.72,0:43:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. - A pig's got, like, 14 nipples.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.72,0:43:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没有 - 一头猪有14个乳头
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? They have litters of, like, 10 to 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对吧?有10到14个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.00,0:43:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But well, I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.00,0:43:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.76,0:43:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but you space it out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.76,0:43:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但你...你不能让他一直交配
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.80,0:43:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't have 50 piglets at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.80,0:43:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能同时有50头小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.96,0:44:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have 50 small little piglets running around at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.96,0:44:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会同时有50头小猪崽跑来跑去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.96,0:44:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.96,0:44:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.72,0:44:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.72,0:44:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的 完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.88,0:44:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd be highly cautious about doing anything around these banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.88,0:44:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.08,0:44:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在堤坝周围做事时会非常谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.04,0:44:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.04,0:44:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.96,0:44:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit! I've never seen incompetence like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.96,0:44:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼 我从没见过这么没用的人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.56,0:44:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.60,0:44:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.60,0:44:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...很惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.52,0:44:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}flabbergasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.76,0:44:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译: 匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.76,0:44:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 杨婕
